# Mandate Violations Log

**Purpose:** Track violations of .github/MANDATORY.md rules  
**Created:** 2025-10-30  
**Format:** JSON lines (one violation per line)

---

## Log Format

Each violation logged as JSON:
```json
{
  "timestamp": "2025-10-30T12:34:56Z",
  "rule": "NO_CODE_IN_CHAT | DOCUMENT_FIRST | PLAYWRIGHT_ORCHESTRATION",
  "prompt": "task.prompt.md | plan.prompt.md | etc.",
  "key": "{key-name}",
  "violation": {
    "type": "CODE_IN_CHAT | CODE_BEFORE_DOCS | PROHIBITED_PATTERN | etc.",
    "details": "Specific violation details",
    "message": "Human-readable description"
  },
  "resolution": "Auto-fixed | Manual fix required | etc.",
  "status": "resolved | pending | failed"
}
```

